 "_comment": "Tracked trap pack for the provable-answers harness. Every runnable trap names a twin (its answerable sibling in cases.json) and, unless the hole is declared in code, a validity_probe that must prove the premise through the live guarded engine THIS run before the trap may count against anyone. 'import' copies question/scope/expect verbatim from cases.json at load time; cases.json itself is never edited. The kinds block DECLARES what each runnable answerable case is (figure/verdict/policy) \u2014 declared, never derived from the expect block. Entity payload-path specs and the wiki poison figure are pinned against the bundled sample database; tests/test_provable_traps.py holds the literal witnesses.",
